Vimar By-me Alarm

This project is an independent community integration and is not affiliated with
or endorsed by Vimar.

Implementation techniques, TLS compatibility and the Vimar Web Server SOAP/database
approach are derived in part from:

  h4de5/home-assistant-vimar
  https://github.com/h4de5/home-assistant-vimar
  License: GPL-3.0

The passive TCP event-stream investigation and future push-update design are inspired by:

  lohacker10/ha-vimar-doorbell
  https://github.com/lohacker10/ha-vimar-doorbell

SAI-specific behavior implemented here was reverse engineered from captures made
against a Vimar 01946 Web Server running firmware 2.11.
